$DATUM The cyano esters 6 are valuable bifonctional building blocks and can, for
instance, be converted, to cis-4,5-disubstituted piperidtn-2-ones by
reductive lactamization with Raney-nickel, as was demonstrated in the
case of (S,S)-7a. (4S,5S)-Dimethyl-piperidine-2-one[(S,S)-7a], yield 79%.
de, ee > 92 %. bp. 100°C, 0.2 Torr, [α]25D = - 30.3 (c = 1.01, CHCl3);
de, ee 2:92 % (β-cyclodextrin column, see Table 1, footnote c). IR(film):
1650 cm-1; 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz): δ = 0.87 (d.6H, 2, CH3), 1.82-1.95
(m,2H,Hc,Hd), 2.01 (dd, 1H. Jab = 17 Hz, Jac = 5.3 Hz, Ha), 2.31 (dd, 1H,
Jha = 17 Hz, Jbc = 5.3 Hz, Hb), 2.91 (ddd, IH, Jfe = 12 Hz. Jfd = 7 Hz.
Jf = 2.3 Hz, Hf), 3.15 (ddd, IH, Ja= 12 Hz, Jc = 5 Hz, Jhe = 2 Hz, He),
4.49 (br.s, 1H, NHg) ppm; 13C NMR (CDCl3,75 MHz): δ = 13.13 (4-CH3).
14.82 (5- CH3), 30.22 (C-4), 30.43 (C-5), 37.13 (C-3), 45.85 (C-6),
172.34 (C-2) ppm; MS (70eV): m/z (%) = 128 (M+- +1,8); 127 (M+, 74), 112
(13), 84(43), 71(24), 70(36), 69(22), 57(29), 56(100). 55(22), 43(33),
42(27), 41(59), 39(29).
